        "profile_id": "published-baseline-fidelity",
        "purpose": "Select the published seven generators, SolubleMPNN and SolubleCaliby, and three co-fold modes, with a disclosed C-alpha ProteinMPNN route for Genie3. Configure the campaign with the published protocol and resolve each selected route before execution.",
