        "baseline_fidelity": false,
        "optimization_enabled": true,
        "production_scoring": false,
        "production_scoring_reason": "This profile states a selection, not a completed run. Genie3 emits a C-alpha trace and uses ProteinMPNN C-alpha weights because SolubleMPNN has no C-alpha checkpoint. Five generators reach their models through operator-deployed fal applications; no endpoint is named here.",
