          {
            "published_arm": "genie3",
            "status": "substituted",
            "selected_designer": "proteinmpnn",
            "reason": "Genie3 emits a C-alpha trace. SolubleMPNN has no C-alpha checkpoint and cannot be combined with --ca-only; ProteinMPNN with --ca-only selects the compatible C-alpha checkpoint. This changes the published designer roster."
